flowchart LR
    subgraph JOURNEY[訪客旅程]
        ARRIVE[在沒有先備背景下開始瀏覽]
        UNDERSTAND[了解活動]
        CHOOSE[選擇活動場次]
        PREPARE[準備到訪]
        VISIT[依照場地與地圖指引到訪]
        CONTINUE[繼續探索品牌故事<br/>與數碼指南手冊]
    end

    subgraph SUPPORT[支援機制]
        MOBILE_NAV[行動裝置導覽]
        STABLE_ANCHORS[穩定的章節錨點]
    end

    subgraph EXTERNAL[外部交接]
        BOOKING[The Ground 報名頁面]
    end

    ARRIVE --> UNDERSTAND
    UNDERSTAND --> CHOOSE
    CHOOSE --> PREPARE
    PREPARE --> VISIT
    VISIT --> CONTINUE

    MOBILE_NAV -.->|支援活動定位| UNDERSTAND
    MOBILE_NAV -.->|支援場次選擇| CHOOSE
    STABLE_ANCHORS -.->|直接前往到訪須知| PREPARE
    STABLE_ANCHORS -.->|直接前往抵達資訊| VISIT
    CHOOSE -.->|前往報名| BOOKING

    classDef journey fill:#eaf4e1,stroke:#48633c,color:#20301b
    classDef support fill:#f0eef5,stroke:#675b79,color:#312a3a
    classDef external fill:#f7eadf,stroke:#8a5834,color:#442a18
    class ARRIVE,UNDERSTAND,CHOOSE,PREPARE,VISIT,CONTINUE journey
    class MOBILE_NAV,STABLE_ANCHORS support
    class BOOKING external
